        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Stage 0: Open, add, resume (priority-zero)&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=stage-0`&#10;&#10;- Family: intake / cross-cutting (INTAKE)&#10;- Catalog verbs: unmapped (no recorded mapping)&#10;- Trying to: Start from the actual project, never a setup ritual: open, add or resume admits only missing eligible work; pause/resume controls admission — no Start ritual.&#10;- How:&#10;  - reconcile bindings; reuse dependency-valid receipts&#10;  - gate writes; reads use stable versioned snapshots&#10;  - the one control is pause/resume (+ scope), never start&#10;  - checkpoint-trusting; repair only on detected breakage: NULL content_sha256 / mixed basis_hash then receipted backfill, never auto-run&#10;  - revisit affected evidence only; no blanket reanalysis&#10;  - reopen reuses valid work; changed evidence re-keys work&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: .gpr / repo / binaries / prior receipts&#10;  - out: one active project, known state, no duplicate work&#10;- Gate: mutation-admission only (real owner state). In the app: `?node=gate-0`" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#stage-0" id="stage-0"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L2"><mxGeometry x="40" y="200" width="400" height="380" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
