        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Stage 1: Identity&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=stage-1`&#10;&#10;- Family: identity (IDENTITY)&#10;- Catalog verbs (consolidated plan §2.1): `corpus.extract-stabs` then `corpus.match-pair`&#10;- Tag: in parallel: extraction + indexing run in parallel&#10;- Trying to: Decide which functions/entities across builds are logical entity, implementation variant and instance; similarity does not prove interchangeable behavior.&#10;- How:&#10;  - extract facts once; short-circuit identical images&#10;  - cheap-first cascade: symbols/provenance then exact &amp; reloc-normalized hashes then rare refs / C++ meta then neighborhood then CFG/SPP then BSim then ABI then optional BinDiff/BinExport then optional emulation on residue&#10;  - require uniqueness + margin; keep ambiguity; withdraw bad seeds + unsupported descendants&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: analyzed programs, debug info, formats&#10;  - out: entity / variant / instance + evidence lineage&#10;- Gate: candidate is not acceptance. In the app: `?node=gate-1`" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#stage-1" id="stage-1"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L2"><mxGeometry x="474" y="200" width="400" height="380" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="c41" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#20232a;strokeColor=#3a3f4a;strokeWidth=1.2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="stage-1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="400" height="380" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c42" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#2b4a7a;strokeColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="stage-1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="400" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c43" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#2b4a7a;strokeColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="stage-1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="22" width="400" height="8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
