        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Stage 2: Incremental calibration&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=stage-2`&#10;&#10;- Family: source recovery (SOURCE RECOVERY)&#10;- Catalog verbs (consolidated plan §2.1): `corpus.calibrate-global`&#10;- Trying to: Establish minimum platform facts, then refine compiler, ABI and layout hypotheses with identity and function evidence; version each input.&#10;- How:&#10;  - compiler/linker + headers/libs + macros + FP mode&#10;  - scope: build / library / TU / function overrides&#10;  - group fragments into TUs/LTCG as required&#10;  - probe legacy switches; record scoped dependencies&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: identified builds + toolchain evidence&#10;  - out: calibration record (part of the basis)&#10;- Gate: none (this stage has no gate)" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#stage-2" id="stage-2"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L2"><mxGeometry x="908" y="200" width="400" height="380" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
