        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Stage 3: Validated linkable regions&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=stage-3`&#10;&#10;- Family: source recovery (SOURCE RECOVERY)&#10;- Catalog verbs (consolidated plan §2.1): `corpus.workspace`&#10;- Trying to: Reconstruct objects and placement from the image; keep uncertain boundaries in larger regions; prove reconstruction before scaling source work.&#10;- How:&#10;  - bytes + fixups + refs + data + unwind metadata&#10;  - architecture-specific objects / external assembly&#10;  - extract then emit then place then compare original bytes&#10;  - then prove a compiled replacement actually contributes&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: calibration + donor build&#10;  - out: validated region scaffold; floor is not recovered C&#10;- Gate: round trip + independent linked-image oracle. In the app: `?node=gate-3`" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#stage-3" id="stage-3"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L2"><mxGeometry x="1342" y="200" width="400" height="380" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
