        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Stage 6: Targeted AI (leftovers only)&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=stage-6`&#10;&#10;- Family: source recovery (SOURCE RECOVERY)&#10;- Catalog verbs (consolidated plan §2.1): `corpus.genproject` (leftovers)&#10;- Trying to: Spend model effort ONLY on what deterministic methods left behind — leaves before callers.&#10;- How:&#10;  - residue queue, tagged with WHY AI was needed&#10;  - diagnose behavior/types then ABI then context then codegen&#10;  - LLM output is a candidate — never a trusted edge&#10;  - ReAgent checker; record exact proposals + bounds&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: residue after 4 to 5&#10;  - out: candidate C for review + provenance&#10;- Gate: candidate only. In the app: `?node=gate-6`" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#stage-6" id="stage-6"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L2"><mxGeometry x="2774" y="200" width="400" height="380" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
