        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Stage 7: Continuous parity&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=stage-7`&#10;&#10;- Family: verification &amp; determinism (VERIFICATION)&#10;- Catalog verbs (consolidated plan §2.1): `corpus.objdiff-check`&#10;- Trying to: Compare emitted code/data against validated targets and independently against linked bytes.&#10;- How:&#10;  - objdiff local + linked-region checks (LTCG aware)&#10;  - reccmp: supported MSVC / PDB diagnostics&#10;  - compile / ABI / tested behavior / local / linked&#10;  - a function-level zero is NOT whole-image proof&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: emitted regions + validated original references&#10;  - out: separate facts with mapping, bounds + evidence&#10;- Gate: local zero is not full-image or behavior proof. In the app: `?node=gate-7`" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#stage-7" id="stage-7"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L2"><mxGeometry x="3208" y="200" width="400" height="380" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
