        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Stage 8: Whole-image byte identity&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=stage-8`&#10;&#10;- Family: verification &amp; determinism (VERIFICATION)&#10;- Catalog verbs: unmapped (no recorded mapping)&#10;- Tag: terminal&#10;- Trying to: The terminal goal: relink into a file whose whole-file hash EQUALS the shipped binary.&#10;- How:&#10;  - early stage-3 round trips; fresh terminal compilation&#10;  - reproduce section order, padding, headers, IAT, relocs&#10;  - prove replacement use then whole-file byte/hash check&#10;  - two variants measured separately: byte-accurate+floor vs max-C; never borrow a receipt between them&#10;  - reconstruction is not original-style rebuild; record method&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: scoped parity + contribution map + layout recipe&#10;  - out: rebuilt image + whole-file hash receipt&#10;- Gate: whole-file hash equality. In the app: `?node=gate-8`" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#stage-8" id="stage-8"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L2"><mxGeometry x="3642" y="200" width="400" height="380" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
