        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Name precedence (per field)&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=lane-A-card-1`&#10;&#10;- Tag: field-level&#10;- Trying to: Keep the strongest name for every field, never let a placeholder win.&#10;- How:&#10;  - human annotation then debug info / STABS then authentic symbols then analysis names then placeholders&#10;  - provenance + rejected alternatives retained&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: all builds' names&#10;  - out: merged names with origin" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#lane-A-card-1" id="lane-A-card-1"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="lane-A"><mxGeometry x="0" y="58" width="500" height="216" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
