        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Portable signatures (identity is not locator)&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=lane-B-card-1`&#10;&#10;- Tag: deterministic&#10;- Trying to: Discover supported entities across related builds; record absent, ambiguous and unsupported outcomes.&#10;- How:&#10;  - identity evidence cascade is not runtime locator search&#10;  - runtime LOCATOR family: reloc-masked window then anchor-relative (import/export/string) then verify hash&#10;  - corpus-computed uniqueness + margin shipped in pack&#10;  - library/CRT excluded; identical bodies then anchors&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: raw image + decode + reloc table&#10;  - out: logical_signature per entity + coverage" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#lane-B-card-1" id="lane-B-card-1"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="lane-B"><mxGeometry x="0" y="58" width="500" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
