        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Data-root locator families&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=lane-B-card-3`&#10;&#10;- Trying to: Known build: identity then RVA then live check. Unknown build: applicable discovery + refusal.&#10;- How:&#10;  - symbol then xref-from-identified-function then anchor-rel then masked adjacency then pointer chain then vtable/RTTI known-build RVA is preferred; portable:false&#10;  - resolver: verify, memoize per build hash, report member, REFUSE, never zero&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: entities + xrefs&#10;  - out: per-root recipes + per-build coverage&#10;- Gate: verify before trust" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#lane-B-card-3" id="lane-B-card-3"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="lane-B"><mxGeometry x="1028" y="58" width="500" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
