        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Divergence (3-way, never forced)&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=lane-B-card-4`&#10;&#10;- Trying to: When the surrounding logic is too different, SAY so and SHOW it — never fake a match.&#10;- How:&#10;  - CFG delta + neighborhood symmetric difference&#10;  - integer components, rational thresholds (no floats)&#10;  - one-to-one, split-or-inlined, diverged&#10;  - review lane shows why; nothing propagates silently&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: cross-build pairs&#10;  - out: relation + class + evidence" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#lane-B-card-4" id="lane-B-card-4"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="lane-B"><mxGeometry x="1542" y="58" width="500" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
