        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Codecaves &amp; ABI (Lua-ready)&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=lane-B-card-5`&#10;&#10;- Trying to: Export what injection needs, portable: caves as plan templates, ABI as data.&#10;- How:&#10;  - cave = anchor-sig + offset + capacity REQUIREMENT + relocation rules + originals + restoration + claim&#10;  - ABI: convention, this-kind, per-arg storage, sret&#10;  - allocation policy + lifetime checks; refusal supported&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: entities + validation rules&#10;  - out: caves[] + abi blocks in pack v2&#10;- Gate: exported plan is not live detour permission" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#lane-B-card-5" id="lane-B-card-5"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="lane-B"><mxGeometry x="2056" y="58" width="500" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
