        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Generic core, adapters&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=lane-B-card-6`&#10;&#10;- Tag: 3 layers&#10;- Trying to: No product ever in the core.&#10;- How:&#10;  - L1 core: any PE/ELF/Mach-O/XBE — masks, CFG, caves&#10;  - L2 arch adapter: detour width, relocs, reach&#10;  - L3 engine adapter + build profile: script API, this-kind&#10;  - names live in external data packs only&#10;  - pack.json + sha256 in the basis; missing pack then missing_adapter, never a default" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#lane-B-card-6" id="lane-B-card-6"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="lane-B"><mxGeometry x="2570" y="58" width="500" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
