        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Pack then resolve&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=lane-C-card-1`&#10;&#10;- Trying to: Verify build identity and live evidence before authorizing each requested runtime operation.&#10;- How:&#10;  - try members in order; verify each; memoize by image hash&#10;  - known: recorded RVA first then expected live bytes&#10;  - unknown: bounded discovery; report uncertainty&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: hookpack v2 + live image&#10;  - out: located/readable/callable/detourable/writable&#10;- Gate: verify or refuse" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#lane-C-card-1" id="lane-C-card-1"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="lane-C"><mxGeometry x="0" y="58" width="500" height="216" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
