        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Preflight then controlled call/install&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=lane-C-card-2`&#10;&#10;- Trying to: Never write into a process blind.&#10;- How:&#10;  - capacity + originals + page protection checked live&#10;  - tested install/remove + safe trampoline reclamation&#10;  - ABI / object lifetime / thread / policy / owner checked&#10;  - byte journal rollback is not undo of executed side effects&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: resolved sites&#10;  - out: installed hooks / typed calls&#10;- Gate: quiescence + claim" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#lane-C-card-2" id="lane-C-card-2"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="lane-C"><mxGeometry x="514" y="58" width="500" height="216" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
