        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Learn the build&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=lane-C-card-4`&#10;&#10;- Tag: records uncertainty&#10;- Trying to: Each new build contributes provisional evidence; contradictions may lower accepted coverage.&#10;- How:&#10;  - export per-member resolution results as a build report&#10;  - corpus ingests runtime_claim rows — never identity; bind_identities promotes or rejects (receipt + delete)&#10;  - residue re-attacked offline (BSim, emulation)&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: build report&#10;  - out: accepted/rejected evidence; updated coverage" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#lane-C-card-4" id="lane-C-card-4"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="lane-C"><mxGeometry x="1542" y="58" width="500" height="216" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
