        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Two gates&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=lane-D-card-2`&#10;&#10;- Trying to: Prove reproducibility, don't assume it.&#10;- How:&#10;  - export byte-diff: export twice then identical bytes&#10;  - cascade harness: three layouts (canonical, shuffled rows + shuffled binary order, + VACUUM/ANALYZE) + key-stability run then identity, match (incl. id), logical_function, recovery_family equal as sorted row-sets&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: store&#10;  - out: pass / first differing key&#10;- Gate: both must pass" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#lane-D-card-2" id="lane-D-card-2"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="lane-D"><mxGeometry x="514" y="58" width="500" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
