        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Ordering discipline&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=lane-D-card-3`&#10;&#10;- Trying to: No hidden order can reach a persisted value.&#10;- How:&#10;  - every SELECT feeding a decision has a total ORDER BY&#10;  - every 'best/first' pick has a total tie-break&#10;  - sets/dicts sorted before hashing or serializing&#10;  - floats rounded before persistence" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#lane-D-card-3" id="lane-D-card-3"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="lane-D"><mxGeometry x="1028" y="58" width="500" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
