        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Objects &amp; logs&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=lane-E-card-1`&#10;&#10;- Tag: substrate&#10;- Trying to: Working state supports independent replicas: content-addressed, log-structured, network-capable.&#10;- How:&#10;  - sha256 objects, write-once (If-None-Match / atomic rename)&#10;  - per-partition append-only logs of signed, chained records&#10;  - heads = one CAS pointer per partition; rebuilt by chain scan&#10;  - adapters: local, S3-compatible, static mirror, peer HTTP&#10;  - compaction: signed checkpoints; peers prune below them&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: inputs, sources, objects, receipts&#10;  - out: immutable objects + verifiable partition chains&#10;- Gate: write-once; chain verifies offline" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#lane-E-card-1" id="lane-E-card-1"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="lane-E"><mxGeometry x="0" y="58" width="500" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
