        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Tasks &amp; frontier&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=lane-E-card-2`&#10;&#10;- Tag: never awaited&#10;- Trying to: Jobs bounded and addressable; resume where inputs exist; result exists is not independently accepted claim.&#10;- How:&#10;  - task_id = sha256(kind, version, inputs, params, basis projection)&#10;  - frontier from log; admission checks live resources separately&#10;  - expired lease fences publication; uncertain resources quarantine&#10;  - persistent input-scoped retry budget; deadline is not termination&#10;  - a basis field change re-keys only the kinds that consume it&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: partition chain + checkpoint index&#10;  - out: offered tasks, result objects, timeout records&#10;- Gate: basis projection admitted" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#lane-E-card-2" id="lane-E-card-2"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="lane-E"><mxGeometry x="514" y="58" width="500" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
