        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Join (one command)&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=lane-E-card-3`&#10;&#10;- Tag: capability-only&#10;- Trying to: Any machine, one verb: laptop, donated idle box, free cloud node, browser tab.&#10;- How:&#10;  - attach-first: find the running local agent, never a second start&#10;  - canaries prove capability: python, parity, toolchain, analyzer&#10;  - capability decides lanes and fetches — a role never does&#10;  - roles decide only mirrors + who signs invites / verifies / applies&#10;  - outbound HTTPS only; no inbound port; --idle-only, --cores N&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: invite URL + what the node can prove&#10;  - out: lanes offered by canary; inputs fetched by task&#10;- Gate: canary hash = pinned value" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#lane-E-card-3" id="lane-E-card-3"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="lane-E"><mxGeometry x="1028" y="58" width="500" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
