        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Verify (every result a proposal)&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=lane-E-card-4`&#10;&#10;- Tag: H8&#10;- Trying to: Trust the hash, never the key — fleet nodes included.&#10;- How:&#10;  - acceptance requires independent evidence roots, not just keys&#10;  - recompute or hash-lookup; byte-exact = recompile + parity&#10;  - no quorum, no credit, no reputation; a liar wastes at most 4 verifies&#10;  - donated .obj / .bin never evidence (byte-emitter refuted)&#10;  - verification ordered before generation (no livelock)&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: proposals from any key&#10;  - out: result-verified / result-refuted records&#10;- Gate: independent evidence lineage" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#lane-E-card-4" id="lane-E-card-4"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="lane-E"><mxGeometry x="1542" y="58" width="500" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
