        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Views (SQLite as a materialized view)&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=lane-E-card-5`&#10;&#10;- Tag: H1 / H11&#10;- Trying to: The corpus store and the similarity index are replays of verified records: deletable, rebuildable, never locked by work.&#10;- How:&#10;  - one applier per view; bounded transactions; ack after commit&#10;  - identity / logical / match / knowledge / receipts from deltas&#10;  - view-stale is a named state with an age (H11), never a stall&#10;  - no worker ever opens a view for writing (H1 by construction)&#10;  - adgrid view materialize rebuilds from record 1&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: result-verified records&#10;  - out: grid_* tables, similarity index, receipts&#10;- Gate: materialize twice then identical dump" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#lane-E-card-5" id="lane-E-card-5"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="lane-E"><mxGeometry x="2056" y="58" width="500" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="c623" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#20232a;strokeColor=#3a3f4a;strokeWidth=1.2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-5"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="500" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c624" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#2c2f36;strokeColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-5"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="500" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c625" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#2c2f36;strokeColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-5"><mxGeometry x="0" y="22" width="500" height="8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c626" value="Views (SQLite as a materialized view)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=13.5;fontColor=#f2f4f7;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-5"><mxGeometry x="10" y="5.83" width="305.7" height="18.9" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c627" value="H1 / H11" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=9.5;fontColor=#b0b6c2;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-5"><mxGeometry x="438.4" y="27.02" width="51.6" height="13.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c628" value="Trying to:" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#b0b6c2;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-5"><mxGeometry x="10" y="36.98" width="69" height="14.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c629" value="The corpus store and the similarity index are replays of" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-5"><mxGeometry x="10" y="50.92" width="366.64" height="16.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c630" value="verified records: deletable, rebuildable, never locked by work." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-5"><mxGeometry x="10" y="65.92" width="411.72" height="16.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c631" value="How:" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#b0b6c2;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-5"><mxGeometry x="10" y="85.98" width="31.2" height="14.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c632" value="• one applier per view; bounded transactions; ack after commit" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-5"><mxGeometry x="10" y="100.45" width="387.92" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c633" value="• identity / logical / match / knowledge / receipts from deltas" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-5"><mxGeometry x="10" y="114.95" width="394.08" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c634" value="• view-stale is a named state with an age (H11), never a stall" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-5"><mxGeometry x="10" y="129.45" width="387.92" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c635" value="• no worker ever opens a view for writing (H1 by construction)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-5"><mxGeometry x="10" y="143.95" width="387.92" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c636" value="• adgrid view materialize rebuilds from record 1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-5"><mxGeometry x="10" y="158.45" width="301.68" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c637" value="In → out:" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#b0b6c2;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-5"><mxGeometry x="10" y="177.47" width="62.7" height="14.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c638" value="in: result-verified records" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11;fontColor=#98a0ad;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-5"><mxGeometry x="10" y="191.95" width="172.32" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c639" value="out: grid_* tables · similarity index · receipts" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11;fontColor=#98a0ad;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-5"><mxGeometry x="10" y="206.45" width="301.68" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c640" value="Gate: " style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#f0c060;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-5"><mxGeometry x="10" y="225.47" width="43.8" height="14.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c641" value="materialize twice → identical dump" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11;fontColor=#f0c060;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-5"><mxGeometry x="46" y="224.95" width="215.44" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Fleet (free cloud nodes)&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=lane-E-card-6`&#10;&#10;- Tag: conditional host failover&#10;- Trying to: The operator never depends on volunteers: rented free-tier nodes join with the same command in cloud-init.&#10;- How:&#10;  - adgrid fleet up / down / status / replace; manifest as objects&#10;  - providers: manual, ssh, declared cloud adapters&#10;  - lane placement by canary, never by tier or role&#10;  - host failover needs independent replica + capable worker&#10;  - host loss: continue only with complete surviving input closure&#10;- In to out:&#10;  - in: provider credentials via the secret path; an invite&#10;  - out: nodes that joined; fleet manifest objects&#10;- Gate: user-data = the join command only" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#lane-E-card-6" id="lane-E-card-6"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="lane-E"><mxGeometry x="2570" y="58" width="500" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="c642" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#20232a;strokeColor=#3a3f4a;strokeWidth=1.2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-6"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="500" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
