        <mxCell id="c648" value="The operator never depends on volunteers: rented" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-6"><mxGeometry x="10" y="50.92" width="315.12" height="16.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c649" value="free-tier nodes join with the same command in cloud-init." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-6"><mxGeometry x="10" y="65.92" width="373.08" height="16.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c650" value="How:" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#b0b6c2;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-6"><mxGeometry x="10" y="85.98" width="31.2" height="14.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c651" value="• adgrid fleet up / down / status / replace; manifest as objects" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-6"><mxGeometry x="10" y="100.45" width="400.24" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c652" value="• providers: manual · ssh · declared cloud adapters" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-6"><mxGeometry x="10" y="114.95" width="320.16" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c653" value="• lane placement by canary, never by tier or role" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-6"><mxGeometry x="10" y="129.45" width="307.84" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c654" value="• host failover needs independent replica + capable worker" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-6"><mxGeometry x="10" y="143.95" width="363.28" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c655" value="• host loss: continue only with complete surviving input closure" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-6"><mxGeometry x="10" y="158.45" width="400.24" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c656" value="In → out:" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#b0b6c2;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-6"><mxGeometry x="10" y="177.47" width="62.7" height="14.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c657" value="in: provider credentials via the secret path; an invite" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11;fontColor=#98a0ad;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-6"><mxGeometry x="10" y="191.95" width="344.8" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c658" value="out: nodes that joined; fleet manifest objects" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11;fontColor=#98a0ad;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-6"><mxGeometry x="10" y="206.45" width="289.36" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c659" value="Gate: " style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#f0c060;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-6"><mxGeometry x="10" y="225.47" width="43.8" height="14.7" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c660" value="user-data = the join command only" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11;fontColor=#f0c060;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E-card-6"><mxGeometry x="46" y="224.95" width="209.28" height="15.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c661" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#16181c;strokeColor=#b0b6c2;strokeWidth=1.2;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;fixDash=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E"><mxGeometry x="3084" y="58" width="1216" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c662" value="OUTPUTS  →  who consumes them" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=12;fontColor=#b0b6c2;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E"><mxGeometry x="3098" y="69.4" width="214.8" height="16.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c663" value="→ one package (CLI adgrid) reusable for any CPU/IO-heavy work; the pipeline's lanes are adapters over it" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E"><mxGeometry x="3098" y="93.92" width="675.76" height="16.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c664" value="→ planned grid contracts; implementation status belongs to delivery evidence, not this design diagram" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E"><mxGeometry x="3098" y="110.92" width="656.44" height="16.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c665" value="→ every stage runs as grid tasks: compile / parity / decompile / cascade / export lanes, each a proposal" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E"><mxGeometry x="3098" y="127.92" width="675.76" height="16.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c666" value="→ timeouts record attempt outcomes, not termination; resource release requires evidence; independent acceptance only" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#d8dbe0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="lane-E"><mxGeometry x="3098" y="144.92" width="753.04" height="16.1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Bounded resolution ladders A to F&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=ladders`&#10;&#10;BOUNDED RESOLUTION — try applicable methods; stop with absent / inlined-only / ambiguous / unsupported / insufficient evidence / budget exhausted." link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#ladders" id="ladders"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L4"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2188.25" width="1320" height="21" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="c667" value="BOUNDED RESOLUTION — try applicable methods; stop with absent / inlined-only / ambiguous / unsupported / insufficient evidence / budget exhausted." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=15;fontColor=#f2f4f7;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="ladders"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="1320" height="21" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Ladder A: Function whose bytes changed&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=ladder-A`&#10;&#10;Family: identity (IDENTITY). Members are tried in order; the locator kind, when the diagram shows one, comes first.&#10;&#10;1. anchor_rel: anchor-relative (import/export/string). In the app: `?node=ladder-A-1`&#10;2. caller_callsite: via a resolved CALLER (decode its call). In the app: `?node=ladder-A-2`&#10;3. callee_order: via resolved CALLEES (order match). In the app: `?node=ladder-A-3`&#10;4. data_xref: via data it references (inverse xref). In the app: `?node=ladder-A-4`&#10;5. vtable_slot: via its vtable slot. In the app: `?node=ladder-A-5`&#10;6. neighbour_position: positional neighbour (order-preserving). In the app: `?node=ladder-A-6`&#10;7. structural: structural match (embedded decoder). In the app: `?node=ladder-A-7`&#10;8. region, review-only (region): region match (inlined / split). In the app: `?node=ladder-A-8`&#10;9. symbol: symbol/debug info at runtime. In the app: `?node=ladder-A-9`&#10;10. offline: emulation, BSim on residue. In the app: `?node=ladder-A-10`&#10;11. annotation: annotation with provenance (a claim, never resolved). In the app: `?node=ladder-A-11`&#10;&#10;Terminal outcomes:&#10;&#10;- then: unresolved (per-member reasons)&#10;- two verified hits disagree then contested" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#ladder-A" id="ladder-A"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L4"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2222" width="460" height="366" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
        <mxCell id="c668" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#20232a;strokeColor=#3a3f4a;strokeWidth=1.2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="ladder-A"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="460" height="366" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c669" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#2b4a7a;strokeColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="ladder-A"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="460" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c670" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#2b4a7a;strokeColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="ladder-A"><mxGeometry x="0" y="22" width="460" height="8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
