        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Ladder B: Cave missing or too small&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=ladder-B`&#10;&#10;Family: cross-build unification &amp; export (UNIFICATION &amp; EXPORT). Members are tried in order; the locator kind, when the diagram shows one, comes first.&#10;&#10;1. N candidate caves per anchor. In the app: `?node=ladder-B-1`&#10;2. live cave discovery (validated). In the app: `?node=ladder-B-2`&#10;3. section slack only with expendability proof. In the app: `?node=ladder-B-3`&#10;4. header / stub space only with explicit proof. In the app: `?node=ladder-B-4`&#10;5. executable allocation if process policy permits. In the app: `?node=ladder-B-5`&#10;6. image extension (on-disk patches). In the app: `?node=ladder-B-6`&#10;&#10;Terminal outcomes:&#10;&#10;- then: no_placement / unsupported_dynamic_code" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#ladder-B" id="ladder-B"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L4"><mxGeometry x="514" y="2222" width="460" height="366" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
