        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Ladder C: Data root unresolved&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=ladder-C`&#10;&#10;Family: cross-build unification &amp; export (UNIFICATION &amp; EXPORT). Members are tried in order; the locator kind, when the diagram shows one, comes first.&#10;&#10;1. known build (known_build): identity then RVA then live check. In the app: `?node=ladder-C-1`&#10;2. unknown: symbol / debug info. In the app: `?node=ladder-C-2`&#10;3. xref_from_function: xref from identified function. In the app: `?node=ladder-C-3`&#10;4. data_xref: inverse access-instruction scan. In the app: `?node=ladder-C-4`&#10;5. anchor_rel: relative to import/export/string. In the app: `?node=ladder-C-5`&#10;6. masked_window: data-section adjacency. In the app: `?node=ladder-C-6`&#10;7. pointer_chain: from a resolved root. In the app: `?node=ladder-C-7`&#10;8. via constructor / initializer. In the app: `?node=ladder-C-8`&#10;9. vtable_slot: vtable / RTTI-derived. In the app: `?node=ladder-C-9`&#10;10. value-shape probe + independent confirmation. In the app: `?node=ladder-C-10`&#10;&#10;Terminal outcomes:&#10;&#10;- then: unresolved — never a silent zero" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#ladder-C" id="ladder-C"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L4"><mxGeometry x="988" y="2222" width="460" height="366" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
