        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Ladder F: Unknown build&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=ladder-F`&#10;&#10;Family: runtime reuse / learn (RUNTIME). Members are tried in order; the locator kind, when the diagram shows one, comes first.&#10;&#10;1. admit in signature-only mode. In the app: `?node=ladder-F-1`&#10;2. run applicable ladders within declared budget. In the app: `?node=ladder-F-2`&#10;3. record every resolution + residue. In the app: `?node=ladder-F-3`&#10;4. ingest as runtime_claim then bind_identities confirms then KNOWN. In the app: `?node=ladder-F-4`&#10;5. residue re-attacked offline. In the app: `?node=ladder-F-5`&#10;&#10;Terminal outcomes:&#10;&#10;- coverage may regress when collisions are found" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#ladder-F" id="ladder-F"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L4"><mxGeometry x="2410" y="2222" width="460" height="366" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
