        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Legend&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=legend`&#10;&#10;- Solid arrow: data / dependency flow. In the app: `?node=legend-dependency`&#10;- Dashed arrow (dash 6 4): failover / fallback. In the app: `?node=legend-failover`&#10;- Dashed arrow (dash 4 4): feedback — dashed arrow back to an earlier stage. In the app: `?node=legend-feedback`&#10;- Diamond marked G: gate — must pass (compile receipt, verify, hash). In the app: `?node=legend-gate`&#10;- Padlock: serialized — one owner. In the app: `?node=legend-lock`&#10;- Bracket: bracket — eligible independent work may overlap. In the app: `?node=legend-bracket`&#10;- Dashed box (dash 5 4): OUTPUTS and who consumes them. In the app: `?node=legend-outputs`&#10;- Colour swatch named by the header word IDENTITY: identity. In the app: `?node=legend-family-identity`&#10;- Colour swatch named by the header word SOURCE RECOVERY: source recovery. In the app: `?node=legend-family-recovery`&#10;- Colour swatch named by the header word UNIFICATION &amp; EXPORT: cross-build unification &amp; export. In the app: `?node=legend-family-unify`&#10;- Colour swatch named by the header word RUNTIME: runtime reuse / learn. In the app: `?node=legend-family-runtime`&#10;- Colour swatch named by the header word VERIFICATION: verification &amp; determinism. In the app: `?node=legend-family-verify`&#10;- Colour swatch named by the header word INTAKE: intake / cross-cutting. In the app: `?node=legend-family-intake`&#10;&#10;DESIGN ONLY, future checks NOT RUN. Companions: execution-contracts.svg — evidence/admission; resilience-contracts.svg —…" link="agentdecompile-recovery-pipeline.outline.md#legend" id="legend"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L7"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2836" width="4320" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
